    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should check with my doctor but i cant really get an appointment for like 3 weeks and i'm feeling pretty bad now. is it really that big of a deal though? i mean it's just a natural herb, it shouldn't mess with my hormones that much right?",
